# SEO Compliance — Nabarun Public Site

Static Next.js export (`output: 'export'`). Every public page must be crawlable HTML with correct metadata.

## Required for every page

- `generateMetadata()` via `buildPageMetadata()` / `buildPageMetadataFromContent()` in `src/lib/site.ts`
- Unique `title`, `description`, `canonical`, `robots`, Open Graph, and Twitter tags
- Exactly one `<h1>` (visible or `visually-hidden` on home only)
- Root layout must **not** set page-level `robots` or home title — only `metadataBase`, icons, verification

## Content-driven SEO (`public/content2.json`)

- Page URLs: `metadata.pages.*.path` (trailing slash, e.g. `/about/`)
- Per-page OG image: `metadata.pages.*.ogImage` (internal path or absolute URL)
- Exclude from index: `metadata.pages.*.noindex: true` (also skips sitemap)
- Sitemap tuning: `metadata.pages.*.sitemap.priority`, `changefreq`, `lastmod`
- Nav env overrides use `NAV_` prefix (e.g. `NAV_LOGIN`), never bare `HOME`

## Structured data (`src/components/seo/`)

- `OrganizationJsonLd`: use `layout.common.org` for email/phone/social — never hardcode contact info
- `BreadcrumbJsonLd` on inner pages via `PageBannerShell`
- `EventJsonLd` on `/events/`
- Projects are a **single page** at `/projects/` — no per-project slug routes or JSON-LD

## Images & performance

- Use `ContentImage` (WebP via `<picture>` when `.webp` sibling exists)
- Run `npm run optimize:images` before release (also runs in `prebuild`)
- Hero/carousel images: unique, descriptive `alt` text in content JSON
- Static export keeps `images.unoptimized: true`; do not rely on Next.js image optimizer

## Sitemap & robots

- `src/app/sitemap.ts` → `buildContentSitemap()` must include `lastModified`
- Skip `noindex` pages and respect `NEXT_PUBLIC_NOINDEX=true` on staging
- Internal links must match `trailingSlash: true` (e.g. `/projects/`, `/about/`)

## Staging vs production

- Production: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://ngonabarun.web.app`
- Staging: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://ngonabarun-stage.web.app` + `NEXT_PUBLIC_NOINDEX=true`

## Optional env (set before deploy)

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID`

## Pre-deploy checklist

1. `npm run build` (runs image optimization in prebuild)
2. Verify `out/sitemap.xml` and `out/robots.txt`
3. Confirm no `index, follow` on `out/404/index.html`
4. Submit sitemap in Google Search Console after deploy
